passages.text:
Formerly included in the genus
Lasjia {{au|P.H.Weston & [[Austin Mast|A.R.Mast]]}}, formerly Macadamia until 2008
Lasjia claudiensis {{au|(C.L.Gross & [[Bernard Hyland|B.Hyland]]) {{interlanguage link|Peter H. Weston|az|Piter Henri Ueston|es|Peter Henry Weston|it|Peter Henry Weston|ru|Уэстон, Питер Хенри}} & A.R.Mast}}; synonym, base name: Macadamia claudiensis {{au|C.L.Gross & B.Hyland}}
Lasjia erecta {{au|(J.A.McDonald & R.Ismail) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; synonym, base name: Macadamia erecta {{au|J.A.McDonald & R.Ismail}}A tree endemic to the island of Sulawesi, Indonesia. First described by science in 1995.
Lasjia grandis {{au|(C.L.Gross & B.Hyland) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; synonym, base name: Macadamia grandis {{au|C.L.Gross & B.Hyland}}
Lasjia hildebrandii {{au|([[Cornelis Gijsbert Gerrit Jan van Steenis|Steenis]]) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; synonym, base name: Macadamia hildebrandii {{au|Steenis}}Another species endemic to Sulawesi.
Lasjia whelanii {{au|([[Frederick Manson Bailey|F.M.Bailey]]) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; synonyms: base name: Helicia whelanii {{au|F.M.Bailey}}, Macadamia whelanii {{au|(F.M.Bailey) F.M.Bailey}}

Virotia {{au|[[Lawrence Alexander Sidney Johnson|L.A.S.Johnson]] & [[Barbara G. Briggs|B.G.Briggs]]}}, formerly Macadamia until the first species renaming began in 1975 and comprehensive in 2008
Virotia angustifolia {{au|([[Robert Virot|Virot]]) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; synonym, base name: Macadamia angustifolia {{au|Virot}}
Virotia francii {{au|([[André Guillaumin|Guillaumin]]) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; synonym, base name: Roupala francii {{au|Guillaumin}}
Virotia leptophylla {{au|(Guillaumin) L.A.S.Johnson & B.G.Briggs}} (1975 type species); synonym, base name: Kermadecia leptophylla {{au|Guillaumin}} 
Virotia neurophylla {{au|(Guillaumin) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; synonyms: base name: Kermadecia neurophylla {{au|Guillaumin}}, Macadamia neurophylla {{au|(Guillaumin) Virot}}
Virotia rousselii {{au|([[Vieill.]]) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; synonym, base name: Roupala rousselii {{au|Vieill}}
Virotia vieillardi {{au|([[Adolphe-Théodore Brongniart|Brongn.]] & [[Jean Antoine Arthur Gris|Gris]]) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; synonym, base name: Roupala vieillardii {{au|Brongn. & Gris}}

Na sua actual circunscrição taxonómica o género Macadamia inclui as seguintes espécies:
 Macadamia integrifolia {{Au|[[Joseph Maiden|Maiden]] & [[Ernst Betche|Betche]]}}
 Macadamia jansenii {{Au|C.L.Gross & P.H.Weston}}
 Macadamia ternifolia {{Au|[[Ferdinand von Mueller|F.Muell.]]}}
 Macadamia tetraphylla {{Au|[[Lawrence Alexander Sidney Johnson|L.A.S.Johnson]]}}

Anteriormente o género inclui outras espécies validamente descritas que entretanto foram atribuídas aos géneros Lasjia,
Catalepidia e Virotia. Essas espécies a sua distribuição pelos novos géneros é a seguinte:
Lasjia {{au|P.H.Weston & [[Austin Mast|A.R.Mast]]}} (até 2008 parte de Macadamia)
 Lasjia claudiensis {{au|(C.L.Gross & [[Bernard Hyland|B.Hyland]]) [[Peter H. Weston|P.H.Weston]] & A.R.Mast}}; sinónimo, basinómio: Macadamia claudiensis {{au|C.L.Gross & B.Hyland}}
 Lasjia erecta {{au|(J.A.McDonald & R.Ismail) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; sinónimo, basinómio: Macadamia erecta {{au|J.A.McDonald & R.Ismail}}
 Lasjia grandis {{au|(C.L.Gross & B.Hyland) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; sinónimo, basinómio: Macadamia grandis {{au|C.L.Gross & B.Hyland}}
 Lasjia hildebrandii {{au|([[Cornelis Gijsbert Gerrit Jan van Steenis|Steenis]]) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; sinónimo, basinómio: Macadamia hildebrandii {{au|Steenis}}
 Lasjia whelanii {{au|([[Frederick Manson Bailey|F.M.Bailey]]) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; sinónimo, basinómio: Helicia whelanii {{au|F.M.Bailey}}, Macadamia whelanii {{au|(F.M.Bailey) F.M.Bailey}}
Catalepidia {{au|P.H.Weston}} (até 1995 em Macadamia)
Catalepidia heyana {{au|(F.M.Bailey) P.H.Weston}}; sinónimo, basinómio: Helicia heyana {{au|F.M.Bailey}}, Macadamia heyana {{au|(F.M.Bailey) [[Hermann Otto Sleumer|Sleumer]]}}
Virotia {{au|[[Lawrence Alexander Sidney Johnson|L.A.S.Johnson]] & [[Barbara G. Briggs|B.G.Briggs]]}} (antriormente Macadamia, com a primeira espécie a ser renomeada em 1975 e completo em 2008)
Virotia angustifolia {{au|([[Robert Virot|Virot]]) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; sinónimo, basinómio: Macadamia angustifolia {{au|Virot}}
Virotia francii {{au|([[André Guillaumin|Guillaumin]]) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; sinónimo, basinómio: Roupala francii {{au|Guillaumin}}
Virotia leptophylla {{au|(Guillaumin) L.A.S.Johnson & B.G.Briggs}} (espécie tipo desde 1975); sinónimo, basinómio: Kermadecia leptophylla {{au|Guillaumin}}
Virotia neurophylla {{au|(Guillaumin) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; sinónimo, basinómio: Kermadecia neurophylla {{au|Guillaumin}}, Macadamia neurophylla {{au|(Guillaumin) Virot}}
Virotia rousselii {{au|([[Vieill.]]) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; sinónimo, basinómio: Roupala rousselii {{au|Vieill}}
Virotia vieillardi {{au|([[Adolphe-Théodore Brongniart|Brongn.]] & [[Jean Antoine Arthur Gris|Gris]]) P.H.Weston & A.R.Mast}}; sinónimo, basinómio: Roupala vieillardii {{au|Brongn. & Gris}}
